hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1747","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah apne bande ki tauba par us shakhs se zyada khush hota hai jo aisi manzil mein utra jahan halakat ho, aur us ke sath us ki sawari ho jis par us ka khana aur peena ho, phir us ne apna sar rakha aur ek neend soya, phir jaaga to us ki sawari ja chuki thi, yahan tak ke us par garmi aur pyaas sakht ho gayi, ya jo Allah ne chaha, unhon ne kaha: Main apni jagah wapas jata hun, phir wapas aaya aur ek neend soya, phir us ne apna sar uthaya to us ki sawari us ke paas maujood thi."
"1748","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah apne bande ki tauba par tum mein se us shakhs se zyada khush hota hai jo apne oont ko pa le jabke wo us se khule bayaban mein gum ho gaya tha."
"1749","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ko paida farmaya to Us ne apni kitab mein likha, phir wo Us ke paas Arsh ke upar hai: Beshak meri rehmat mere ghazab par ghalib hai."
"1750","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Allah ne rehmat ko sau hisson mein banaya, phir ninyanwe hisse apne paas rok rakhe aur ek hissa zameen mein utara, phir usi hisse se makhlooq ek doosre par rehem karti hai, yahan tak ke ghodi apna khur apne bache se upar uthati hai is dar se ke use lag na jaye."
"1751","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas qaidi laye gaye, to achanak qaidiyon mein se ek aurat thi jis ka than doodh bah raha tha, jab use qaidiyon mein koi bacha milta to use pakad leti, phir use apne pet se lagati aur doodh pilati, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se farmaya: Kya tum dekhte ho ke ye apne bache ko aag mein phenk degi? Hum ne kaha: Nahi, jabke wo is par qadir ho ke use na phenke, phir Aap ne farmaya: Allah apne bandon par is se zyada rehem karne wala hai jitna ye apne bache par hai."
"1752","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne kaha jis ne kabhi koi neki na ki thi: Phir jab wo mar jaye to use jalao, aur us ka aadha bar mein aur aadha samandar mein bikher do, phir Allah ki qasam agar Allah us par qadir hua to use aisa azab dega jo aalameen mein se kisi ko na dega, phir Allah ne samandar ko hukm diya to us ne jo us mein tha jama kar diya, aur bar ko hukm diya to us ne jo us mein tha jama kar diya, phir farmaya: Tune ye kyun kiya? Us ne kaha: Tere dar se, aur Tu zyada janta hai, phir Us ne use bakhsh diya."
"1753","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Tum se pehle ek shakhs tha jise Allah ne maal diya tha, phir us ne apne beton se kaha jab maut aa gayi: Main tumhare liye kaisa baap tha? Unhon ne kaha: Behtareen baap, us ne kaha: Phir beshak main ne kabhi koi neki na ki, phir jab main mar jaun to mujhe jalao, phir mujhe pees dalo, phir mujhe tez hawa wale din bikher do, phir unhon ne aisa kiya, phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne use jama kiya aur farmaya: Tujhe kis cheez ne ubhara? Us ne kaha: Tere dar ne, phir Us ne use apni rehmat ke sath le liya."
"1754","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak ek bande ne gunah kiya, aur kabhi kaha ke us ne gunah kiya, phir kaha: Ae mere Rab main ne gunah kiya, aur kabhi kaha ke main (gunah ko) pahuncha, phir mujhe bakhsh de, phir us ke Rab ne farmaya: Kya mere bande ne jana ke us ka ek Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakadta hai? Main ne apne bande ko bakhsh diya, phir jitna Allah ne chaha thehra raha, phir us ne gunah kiya ya gunah ko pahuncha, phir kaha: Ae mere Rab main ne gunah kiya ya doosre (gunah) ko pahuncha, phir use bakhsh de, phir farmaya: Kya mere bande ne jana ke us ka ek Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakadta hai? Main ne apne bande ko bakhsh diya, phir jitna Allah ne chaha thehra raha, phir us ne gunah kiya, aur kabhi kaha ke gunah ko pahuncha, unhon ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Ae mere Rab main doosre (gunah) ko pahuncha ya gunah kiya, phir use mere liye bakhsh de, phir farmaya: Kya mere bande ne jana ke us ka ek Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakadta hai? Main ne apne bande ko bakhsh diya, teen martaba, phir jo chahe amal kare."
"1755","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahi, aur isi liye Us ne fawahish ko haram kiya, jo un mein se zahir hon aur jo posheeda hon, aur Allah se zyada madh ko mehboob rakhne wali koi cheez nahi, aur isi liye Us ne apni madh khud ki."
"1756","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ghairat farmata hai, aur Allah ki ghairat ye hai ke momin wo kare jo Allah ne haram kiya hai."
"1757","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Allah se zyada ghairat wali koi cheez nahi."
"1758","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne ek aurat se bosa liya, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di, phir Allah ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Namaz qaim karo din ke dono kinaron aur raat ke kuch hisson mein, beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko le jati hain), phir us shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ye mere liye hai? Aap ne farmaya: Meri tamam ummat ke sab ke liye hai."
"1759","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha, phir Aap ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main had (ko pahunchne wale gunah) ko pahuncha hun, phir use mujh par qaim kijiye, unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne us se us ke bare mein na poocha, unhon ne kaha: Aur namaz hazir hui, phir us ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parhi, phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz poori ki to wo shakhs Aap ki taraf khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main had ko pahuncha hun, phir mujh mein Allah ki kitab qaim kijiye, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tune hamare sath namaz nahi parhi? Us ne kaha: Haan, Aap ne farmaya: Phir beshak Allah ne tera gunah bakhsh diya, (ya kaha) teri had."
"1760","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein ek shakhs tha jis ne ninyanwe insaan qatl kiye, phir wo poochhne ke liye nikla, phir ek rahib ke paas aaya aur us se poocha, phir us ne us se kaha: Kya tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, phir us ne use qatl kar diya, phir wo poochhta raha, phir ek shakhs ne us se kaha: Falan falan basti jao, phir use maut ne pa liya aur wo apne seene se us ki taraf jhuka, phir rehmat ke farishton aur azab ke farishton ne us ke bare mein jhagda kiya, phir Allah ne is (basti) ki taraf wahi ki ke qareeb ho ja, aur Allah ne is (doosri) ki taraf wahi ki ke door ho ja, aur farmaya: Dono ke darmiyan naapo, phir wo is (nek basti) ki taraf ek balisht zyada qareeb paya gaya, phir use bakhsh diya gaya."
"1761","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Safwan bin Muhriz al-Mazini ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Ibn Umar ke sath chal raha tha un ka haath pakde hue, achanak ek shakhs samne aaya aur kaha: Tum ne najwa (sar-goshi) ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kya suna? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah momin ko qareeb karega, phir us par apna parda dalega aur use chhupayega, phir farmayega: Kya falan gunah ko pehchanta hai, kya falan gunah ko pehchanta hai? To wo kahega: Haan ae mere Rab, yahan tak ke jab wo use us ke gunahon ka iqrar kara lega aur wo apne dil mein dekhega ke wo halak ho gaya, to farmayega: Main ne duniya mein tujh par parda dala tha aur main aaj tere liye unhe bakhshta hun, phir use us ki nekiyon ka nama diya jayega, aur kafir aur munafiqon ke bare mein gawah kahenge: Ye wo hain jinhon ne apne Rab par jhoot bola, khabardar zalimon par Allah ki lanat ho."
"1762","[AI-translation] Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Aap ki kisi ghazwe se peeche na raha magar ghazwa Tabuk se, siwaye is ke ke main ghazwa Badr mein peeche reh gaya tha, aur Aap ne us se peeche rehne wale kisi ko malamat na ki thi, Aap to sirf Quraish ke qafile ke irade se nikle they, yahan tak ke Allah ne unhe aur un ke dushman ko baghair teh shuda wade ke jama kar diya, aur main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Aqaba ki raat hazri di thi jab hum ne Islam par ehad bandha tha, aur mujhe ye pasand nahi ke us ke badle mujhe Badr ki hazri mile, agarche Badr logon mein us se zyada mashhoor hai, meri khabar ye thi ke main us ghazwe mein peeche rehte waqt kabhi itna taqatwar aur aasan haal na tha jitna tab tha, Allah ki qasam mujh mein us se pehle kabhi do sawaniyan jama na hui thein yahan tak ke main ne us ghazwe mein unhe jama kiya, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab kisi ghazwe ka irada karte to us ke siwa doosri taraf ishara farmate, yahan tak ke wo ghazwa tha jise Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sakht garmi mein kiya, aur lambe safar, bayaban aur bahut dushman ka samna kiya, phir Aap ne musalmanon ke liye un ka mamla khol diya taake wo apne ghazwe ki taiyari karein, phir unhe apna rukh bataya jis ka Aap irada rakhte they, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath musalman bahut they aur unhe koi likhne wala daftar jama na karta tha [yaani deewan], Kaab ne kaha: Phir jo shakhs ghayab hone ka irada karta wo samajhta ke us ke liye posheeda reh jayega, jab tak us ke bare mein Allah ki wahi nazil na ho, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wo ghazwa us waqt kiya jab phal aur saaye khushgawar ho gaye they, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sath musalman taiyar hue, phir main subah ko jata taake un ke sath taiyar hun, phir wapas aata aur kuch na karta, phir apne dil mein kehta: Main is par qadir hun, phir ye silslila mujh mein barhta raha yahan tak ke logon mein sakht koshish barh gayi, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sath musalman subah kar chuke aur main ne apne samaan mein se kuch na kiya tha, phir main ne kaha: Main un ke baad ek ya do din mein taiyar hunga phir un se ja milunga, phir main un ke rawana hone ke baad taiyari ke liye gaya aur wapas aaya aur kuch na kiya, phir gaya phir wapas aaya aur kuch na kiya, phir ye mujh mein raha yahan tak ke wo tez nikal gaye aur ghazwa haath se nikal gaya, aur main ne irada kiya ke kooch karun aur un se ja milun, kaash main ne aisa kiya hota, phir mere liye ye muqaddar na hua, phir jab main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke nikalne ke baad logon mein nikalta aur un mein phirta to mujhe ghamgeen karta ke main sirf us shakhs ko dekhta jis par nifaq ka dagh tha ya un kamzoron mein se jinhe Allah ne uzr diya tha, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe yaad na farmaya yahan tak ke Tabuk pahunch gaye, phir Aap ne farmaya jabke Aap Tabuk mein logon mein baithe they: Kaab ne kya kiya? To Banu Salima mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Use us ki do chadaron aur apne kandhe par nazar ne rok liya, to Muaz bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tune bura kaha, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Hum ne us par khair ke siwa kuch nahi jana, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khamosh rahe, Kaab bin Malik ne kaha: Phir jab mujhe pahunchi ke Aap wapas tashreef la rahe hain to mera gham hazir hua aur main jhoot sochne laga aur kehne laga: Main kal Aap ki narazgi se kis cheez se niklunga, aur is par apne ghar walon mein se har sahib raay se madad li, phir jab kaha gaya ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aate hue qareeb ho gaye hain to mujh se batil door ho gaya, aur main ne jana ke main kabhi is se kisi jhoot wali cheez se na niklunga, phir main ne sach ka pukhta irada kiya, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah tashreef laye, aur jab safar se tashreef late to masjid se shuru karte, phir us mein do rakat parhte, phir logon ke liye baithete, phir jab Aap ne aisa kiya to Aap ke paas peeche rehne wale aaye aur Aap se uzr karne aur Aap ke liye qasmein khane lage, aur wo assi se kuch upar mard they, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se un ka zahir qabool kiya aur un se baiat ki aur un ke liye istighfar kiya aur un ke dilon ko Allah ke hawale kiya, phir main Aap ke paas aaya, phir jab main ne Aap ko salam kiya to Aap narazgi wali muskurahat muskuraye, phir farmaya: Aao, phir main chalta hua aaya yahan tak ke Aap ke samne baitha, phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tujhe kis ne peeche rakha, kya tune apni sawari nahi khareedi thi? To main ne kaha: Haan, beshak main, Allah ki qasam, agar duniya walon mein se Aap ke siwa kisi ke paas hota to dekhta ke uzr se Aap ki narazgi se niklunga, aur mujhe jhagda karna diya gaya hai, lekin Allah ki qasam main ne jan liya hai ke agar main ne aaj Aap se jhoot wali baat kahi jis se Aap mujh se razi hon to qareeb hai ke Allah Aap ko mujh par naraz kare, aur agar main ne Aap se sach wali baat kahi jis mein Aap mujh par naraz hon to beshak main us mein Allah ke afw ki umeed rakhta hun, nahi Allah ki qasam mere liye koi uzr na tha, Allah ki qasam main kabhi itna taqatwar aur aasan haal na tha jitna tab tha jab main Aap se peeche raha, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Is shakhs ne sach kaha hai, phir khade ho jao yahan tak ke Allah tumhare bare mein faisla kare, phir main khada hua aur Banu Salima ke kuch mard uthe aur mere peeche aaye aur mujh se kaha: Allah ki qasam hum ne tumhe is se pehle kabhi koi gunah karte nahi jana tha, aur tum aajiz rahe ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se usi tarah uzr na karte jaise peeche rehne walon ne Aap se uzr kiya, tumhare gunah ke liye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka istighfar kafi ho jata, phir Allah ki qasam wo mujhe malamat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne irada kiya ke wapas jaun aur apne aap ko jhoota kahun, phir main ne un se kaha: Kya mere sath kisi aur ko ye pesh aaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan do mard jin dono ne wahi kaha jo tum ne kaha, phir un dono se wahi kaha gaya jo tum se kaha gaya, phir main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Marara bin al-Rabi al-Amri aur Hilal bin Umayya al-Waqifi, phir unhon ne mujhe do nek mard bataye jo Badr mein hazir hue they, un dono mein mere liye namoona tha, phir main chal para jab unhon ne un dono ka zikr kiya, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne musalmanon ko hum teenon se kalam karne se mana kiya, un mein se jo Aap se peeche rahe they, phir log hum se alag rahe aur hamare liye badal gaye yahan tak ke zameen mere dil mein badal gayi, phir wo wo na rahi jise main pehchanta tha, phir hum is par pachaas raatein rahe, rahe mere do sathi to wo aajiz hue aur apne gharon mein baithe rote rahe, aur raha main to main qaum ka sab se jawan aur mazboot tha, phir main nikalta aur musalmanon ke sath namaz mein hazir hota aur bazaron mein phirta aur mujh se koi kalam na karta, aur main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aata aur Aap ko salam karta jabke Aap namaz ke baad apni majlis mein hote, phir apne dil mein kehta: Kya Aap ne mujh par salam ke jawab mein apne hont hilaye hain ya nahi, phir main Aap ke qareeb namaz parhta aur chhup kar Aap ko dekhta, phir jab main apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjah hota to Aap meri taraf mutawajjah hote, aur jab main Aap ki taraf dekhta to Aap mujh se munh pher lete, yahan tak ke jab mujh par logon ki berukhi lambi hui to main chala yahan tak ke Abu Qatada ke bagh ki deewar par chadha, aur wo mera chachazad tha aur logon mein mujhe sab se mehboob tha, phir main ne use salam kiya, phir Allah ki qasam us ne mujhe salam ka jawab na diya, phir main ne kaha: Ae Abu Qatada! Main tumhe Allah ki qasam deta hun kya tum mujhe jante ho ke main Allah aur Us ke Rasool se mohabbat karta hun? To wo khamosh raha, phir main ne us se dobara kaha aur use qasam di to wo khamosh raha, phir main ne us se dobara kaha aur use qasam di to us ne kaha: Allah aur Us ka Rasool zyada jante hain, phir meri aankhein beh padein aur main wapas hua yahan tak ke deewar par chadha, unhon ne kaha: Phir jabke main Madina ke bazar mein chal raha tha to achanak Sham ke Nabatiyon mein se ek Nabati jo khana lakar Madina mein bechta tha keh raha tha: Kaun Kaab bin Malik ka pata batayega? Phir log us ke liye ishara karne lage yahan tak ke jab wo mere paas aaya to us ne mujhe Ghassan ke badshah ka ek khat diya, phir us mein tha: Us ke baad, beshak mujhe pahunchi hai ke tumhare sathi ne tum se berukhi ki hai, aur Allah ne tumhe zillat aur zaya hone ke ghar mein nahi banaya, phir hum se aa milo hum tumhari ghamkhwari karenge, phir main ne kaha jab main ne use parha: Ye bhi azmaish mein se hai, phir main ne us se tandoor ka rukh kiya aur use us se jala diya, yahan tak ke jab pachas mein se chalees raatein guzar gayein to achanak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka bheja hua mere paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe hukm dete hain ke apni biwi se alag raho, phir main ne kaha: Kya use talaq dun ya kya karun? Us ne kaha: Nahi balke us se alag raho aur us ke qareeb na jao, aur Aap ne mere dono sathiyon ki taraf bhi aisa hi bheja, phir main ne apni biwi se kaha: Apne ghar walon se ja milo aur un ke paas raho yahan tak ke Allah is mamle mein faisla kare, Kaab ne kaha: Phir Hilal bin Umayya ki biwi Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Hilal bin Umayya zaeef budha hai us ka koi khadim nahi, to kya Aap napasand karte hain ke main us ki khidmat karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi lekin wo tumhare qareeb na aaye, unhon ne kaha: Beshak wo, Allah ki qasam, us mein kisi cheez ki taraf harkat nahi, aur Allah ki qasam wo rota raha hai jab se us ka mamla hua tha aaj ke din tak, phir mere ghar walon mein se kisi ne mujh se kaha: Kaash tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apni biwi ke bare mein ijazat mangte jaise Aap ne Hilal bin Umayya ki biwi ko ijazat di ke wo us ki khidmat kare, phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main us ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat na mangunga, aur mujhe kya khabar Aap kya farmayenge jab main us ke bare mein Aap se ijazat mangun jabke main jawan mard hun, phir main us ke baad dus raatein raha yahan tak ke hamare liye pachas raatein poori ho gayein, jab se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamare sath kalam se mana kiya tha, phir jab main ne pachaaswin raat ki subah Fajr ki namaz parhi aur main apne gharon mein se ek ghar ki chhat par tha, phir jabke main usi haal mein baitha tha jise Allah ne zikr kiya, meri jaan mujh par tang ho gayi thi aur zameen apni kushadgi ke bawajood mujh par tang ho gayi thi, to main ne pukarne wale ki awaz suni jo Sala pahad par chadh kar apni buland awaz se keh raha tha: Ae Kaab bin Malik khushkhabri lo, unhon ne kaha: Phir main sajde mein gir para aur jan liya ke kushadgi aa gayi hai, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Allah ki tauba ki khabar di jab Aap ne Fajr ki namaz parhi, phir log hamein khushkhabri dene gaye aur mere dono sathiyon ki taraf khushkhabri dene wale gaye, aur ek shakhs ghode par daud kar meri taraf aaya aur Aslam mein se ek paidal chalne wala dauda aur pahad par chadha, aur awaz ghode se tez thi, phir jab mere paas wo aaya jis ki awaz main ne suni thi mujhe khushkhabri dete hue to main ne apne dono kapde utare aur khushkhabri ke badle use pehna diye, aur Allah ki qasam main us din un dono ke siwa kuch na rakhta tha, aur main ne do kapde udhar liye aur unhe pehna aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf rawana hua, phir log fauj fauj mujhe milte aur tauba ki mubarakbad dete aur kehte: Tumhe Allah ki tauba mubarak ho, Kaab ne kaha: Yahan tak ke main masjid mein dakhil hua to achanak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe they Aap ke gird log they, phir Talha bin Ubaidullah meri taraf daudte hue khade hue aur mujhe mubarakbad di, aur Allah ki qasam Muhajireen mein se us ke siwa koi shakhs meri taraf khada na hua, aur main Talha ke liye use na bhoolunga, Kaab ne kaha: Phir jab main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya jabke khushi se Aap ka chehra chamak raha tha: Tumhe us din ki khushkhabri ho jo tum par guzra hai jab se tumhari maa ne tumhe jana, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya Aap ki taraf se hai Ya Rasulullah ya Allah ki taraf se? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi balke Allah ki taraf se hai, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab khush hote to Aap ka chehra roshan ho jata yahan tak ke goya wo chand ka tukda hai, aur hum Aap se ye pehchante they, phir jab main Aap ke samne baitha to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri tauba mein se hai ke main apne maal se nikal jaun Allah aur Allah ke Rasool ke liye sadqa karke, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apna kuch maal apne liye rok lo, phir wo tumhare liye behtar hai, main ne kaha: Phir beshak main apna hissa rokta hun jo Khaibar mein hai, phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ne mujhe sirf sach se nijat di, aur beshak meri tauba mein se hai ke main jab tak rahun sirf sach kahunga, phir Allah ki qasam main musalmanon mein se kisi ko nahi janta jise Allah ne sach bolne mein aazmaya ho, jab se main ne ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya, mujhe diye gaye se behtar diya ho, main ne jab se ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya aaj ke din tak jan boojh kar jhoot nahi kaha, aur beshak main umeed rakhta hun ke Allah meri hifazat karega jab tak rahun, aur Allah ne apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Beshak Allah ne Nabi aur Muhajireen par tauba ki) is qaul tak: (Aur sadiqeen ke sath ho jao), phir Allah ki qasam Allah ne mujh par kabhi koi nemat na ki, jab se Us ne mujhe Islam ki hidayat di, meri zaat mein mere Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sach bolne se badi, ke main ne Aap se jhoot na kaha warna halak ho jata jaise jhoot bolne wale halak hue, phir beshak Allah ne jhoot bolne walon se kaha jab wahi nazil hui, sab se bura jo kisi se kaha, phir farmaya Tabarak wa Taala: (Wo tum se Allah ki qasmein khayenge jab tum un ki taraf wapas jao) is qaul tak: (Phir beshak Allah fasiq qaum se razi nahi hota), Kaab ne kaha: Aur hum teenon un logon ke mamle se peeche reh gaye jin se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qabool kiya tha jab unhon ne Aap se qasmein khayein, phir Aap ne un se baiat ki aur un ke liye istighfar kiya, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamara mamla multavi kiya yahan tak ke Allah ne us mein faisla kiya, phir isi se Allah ne farmaya: (Aur un teenon par jinhe peeche chhora gaya), aur wo nahi jo Allah ne zikr kiya ke hum ghazwe se peeche reh gaye, wo to sirf hamara peeche karna aur hamara mamla multavi karna tha, un se jo Aap se qasam khate aur Aap se uzr karte aur Aap un se qabool karte."
"1763","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja hain, jab ifk walon ne un ke bare mein wo kaha jo kaha, Aisha ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab safar ka irada karte to apni biwiyon mein qura dalte, phir un mein se jis ka teer nikalta Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use apne sath le jate, Aisha ne kaha: Phir Aap ne hamare darmiyan ek ghazwe mein qura dala jo Aap ne kiya, phir us mein mera teer nikla, phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath nikli hijab nazil hone ke baad, phir main apne haudaj mein uthayi jati aur us mein utari jati, phir hum chale yahan tak ke jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ghazwe se farigh hue aur wapas aate hue Madina ke qareeb hue to ek raat kooch ka elan kiya, phir main khadi hui jab unhon ne kooch ka elan kiya aur chal padi yahan tak ke lashkar se aage nikal gayi, phir jab main ne apni hajat poori ki to apne rehle ki taraf wapas aayi, phir main ne apna seena chhua to achanak mera ek haar jo Zafar ke aqeeq ka tha toot gaya tha, phir main wapas aayi aur apna haar talash kiya, phir us ki talash ne mujhe rok liya, unhon ne kaha: Aur wo jamaat aayi jo mujhe sawari par bithate they, phir unhon ne mera haudaj uthaya aur use mere us oont par bandh diya jis par main sawar hoti thi, jabke wo samajh rahe they ke main us mein hun, aur aurtein us waqt halki thein na moti hui thein aur na unhe gosht ne dhanka tha, wo to khane mein se thoda khati thein, phir qaum ne haudaj ke halke hone ko ajeeb na jana jab unhon ne use uthaya aur laad diya, aur main kam umr londi thi, phir unhon ne oont ko uthaya aur chal pade, aur main ne apna haar paya jab lashkar ja chuka tha, phir main un ki manzilon par aayi aur un mein se koi pukarne wala aur jawab dene wala na tha, phir main ne apni us manzil ka rukh kiya jismein main thi, aur main ne samajha ke wo mujhe na payenge aur meri taraf wapas aayenge, phir jabke main apni manzil mein baithi thi meri aankh mujh par ghalib aa gayi aur main so gayi, aur Safwan bin al-Muattal al-Sulami phir al-Dhakwani lashkar ke peeche tha, phir wo meri manzil ke paas subah ko aaya aur soye hue insan ka saya dekha, phir mujhe pehchan liya jab mujhe dekha, aur us ne mujhe hijab se pehle dekha tha, phir main us ke istirja se jaag gayi jab us ne mujhe pehchana, phir main ne apna chehra apni chadar se chhupaya, aur Allah ki qasam hum ne ek kalima na kaha aur na main ne us se istirja ke siwa koi kalima suna, aur wo jhuka yahan tak ke us ne apni sawari bithayi, phir us ne us ke haath par paon rakha, phir main us ki taraf khadi hui aur us par sawar hui, phir wo sawari ki lagam pakad kar mujhe le chala yahan tak ke hum dopahar ki sakht garmi mein lashkar ke paas aaye jabke wo utre hue they, unhon ne kaha: Phir halak hone wala halak hua, aur ifk ka bojh uthane wala Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul tha, Urwa (hadith ke rawiyon mein se ek) ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi ke wo us ke paas phailaya jata aur us ka tazkira hota to wo use qarar rakhta aur sunta aur ubharta, aur Urwa ne ye bhi kaha: Ifk walon mein se Hassaan bin Sabit, Mistah bin Usasa aur Hamna bint Jahsh ke siwa kisi ka naam na liya gaya, kuch doosre logon mein jin ka mujhe ilm nahi, magar wo jatha they jaise Allah Taala ne farmaya, aur us ka bada bojh Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul ke bare mein kaha jata hai, Urwa ne kaha: Aisha napasand karti thein ke un ke paas Hassaan ko bura kaha jaye aur kehti thein: Beshak wo wo hai jis ne kaha: (Phir beshak mere walid, un ke walid aur meri izzat tum se Muhammad ki izzat ke liye dhaal hai), Aisha ne kaha: Phir hum Madina aaye aur main jab aayi to ek mahina bimar rahi, aur log ifk walon ki baat mein beh rahe they, main us mein se kuch na janti thi, aur mere dard mein mujhe wo shak mein dalta ke main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wo narmi na pehchanti thi jo main Aap se dekhti thi jab main bimar hoti, Aap to bas mere paas Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef late aur salam karte phir kehte: In ka kya haal hai? Phir wapas chale jate, phir ye mujhe shak mein dalta aur main shar se bekhabar thi, yahan tak ke main bahar nikli jab sehatyab hui, phir main Umm Mistah ke sath Manasi ki taraf nikli, aur wo hamari qazae hajat ki jagah thi, aur hum raat se raat ke siwa na nikalte they, aur ye hamare gharon ke qareeb kunaf banane se pehle tha, unhon ne kaha: Aur hamara mamla jungle mein qazae hajat se pehle walon Arab jaisa tha, aur hum gharon ke paas kunaf banane se azaab mehsoos karte they, unhon ne kaha: Phir main aur Umm Mistah niklein, aur wo Abu Ruhm bin al-Muttalib bin Abd Manaf ki beti thi, aur un ki walida Sakhr bin Amir ki beti, Abu Bakr Siddiq ki khala thi, aur un ka beta Mistah bin Usasa bin Ibbad bin al-Muttalib tha, phir main aur Umm Mistah apne ghar ki taraf wapas aayein jab hum apne kam se farigh hue, phir Umm Mistah apni chadar mein thokar khayein aur kaha: Mistah tabah ho, phir main ne un se kaha: Tune bura kaha jo kaha, kya tu us mard ko bura kehti hai jo Badr mein hazir hua? To unhon ne kaha: Ae larki! Kya tune nahi suna us ne kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne kaha: Us ne kya kaha? Phir unhon ne mujhe ifk walon ki baat batayi, unhon ne kaha: Phir mera marz mere marz par barh gaya, phir jab main apne ghar wapas aayi to mere paas Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye aur salam kiya phir farmaya: In ka kya haal hai? To main ne Aap se kaha: Kya Aap mujhe ijazat dete hain ke main apne walidain ke paas jaun? Unhon ne kaha: Aur main un dono ki taraf se khabar ki tehqeeq chahti thi, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe ijazat di, phir main ne apni walida se kaha: Ae meri ammi! Log kya kehte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ae meri beti! Apne liye aasan karo, phir Allah ki qasam kam hi aisi khubsurat aurat hoti hai jo kisi mard ke paas ho jo us se mohabbat karta ho, aur us ki sautanein hon, magar wo us par bahut kehti hain, unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Kya logon ne ye kaha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main us raat subah tak royi, mere aansu na thamte aur na main neend se surma lagaya, phir subah ko main roti rahi, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ali bin Abi Talib aur Usama bin Zaid ko bulaya jab wahi ruk gayi, un dono se poochhte aur apne ghar walon se alag hone mein mashwara karte, unhon ne kaha: Rahe Usama to unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us ka mashwara diya jo wo Aap ke ghar walon ki baraat mein jante they aur jo wo un ke liye apne dil mein jante they, phir Usama ne kaha: Aap ke ghar wale hain aur hum khair ke siwa kuch nahi jante, aur rahe Ali to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ne Aap par tangi nahi ki aur aurtein un ke siwa bahut hain, aur londi se poochho wo tumhe sach batayegi, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Barira ko bulaya aur farmaya: Ae Barira! Kya tune koi cheez dekhi hai jo tumhe shak mein dale? To Barira ne Aap se kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko Haq ke sath bheja, main ne us par kabhi koi mamla nahi dekha jise main bura janun, siwaye is ke ke wo kam umr londi hai, apne ghar walon ke aate par so jati hai, phir paltu bakri aati hai aur use kha jati hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usi din khade hue aur Abdullah bin Ubayy se maazrat talab ki jabke Aap minbar par they, phir farmaya: Ae musalmanon ki jamaat! Mujhe us shakhs se kaun maazrat dilayega jis ki aza mere ghar walon mein mujhe pahunchi hai, aur Allah ki qasam main ne apne ghar walon par khair ke siwa kuch nahi jana, aur unhon ne ek mard ka zikr kiya hai jis par main ne khair ke siwa kuch nahi jana, aur wo mere ghar walon par mere sath ke siwa dakhil nahi hota, unhon ne kaha: Phir Saad bin Muaz khade hue jo Banu Abdul Ashhal ke bhai they aur kaha: Main Ya Rasulullah! Aap ko maazrat dilaunga, phir agar wo Aus mein se hua to main us ki gardan maar dunga, aur agar wo hamare bhaiyon Khazraj mein se hua to Aap hamein hukm dein aur hum Aap ka hukm karein, unhon ne kaha: Phir Khazraj mein se ek mard khada hua, aur Hassaan ki walida us ke chacha ki beti us ke khandan se thi, aur wo Saad bin Ubada tha aur wo Khazraj ka sardar tha, unhon ne kaha: Aur wo us se pehle nek mard tha lekin use hamiyyat ne ubhara, phir us ne Saad se kaha: Tune jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam tum use qatal na karoge aur us ke qatl par qadir na hoge, aur agar wo tumhare khandan se hota to tum na pasand karte ke wo qatal kiya jaye, phir Usaid bin Hudair khade hue, aur wo Saad ke chachazad they, phir unhon ne Saad bin Ubada se kaha: Tune jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam hum use zaroor qatal karenge, phir beshak tum munafiq ho jo munafiqon ki taraf se jhagadte ho, unhon ne kaha: Phir dono qabile Aus aur Khazraj ubhre yahan tak ke unhon ne irada kiya ke qital karein jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) minbar par khade they, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhe thanda karte rahe yahan tak ke wo khamosh hue aur Aap khamosh hue, unhon ne kaha: Phir main us din bhar roti rahi, mere aansu na thamte aur na main neend se surma lagaya, unhon ne kaha: Aur mere walidain mere paas subah ko aaye, aur main do raatein aur ek din ro chuki thi, mere aansu na thamte aur na main neend se surma lagati, yahan tak ke main samajhti ke rona mera kaleja phaad dega, phir jabke mere walidain mere paas baithe they aur main ro rahi thi to Ansar mein se ek aurat ne mujh se ijazat mangi, phir main ne use ijazat di aur wo mere sath rone baithi, unhon ne kaha: Phir jabke hum is par they to hamare paas Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye aur salam kiya phir baithe, unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap mere paas na baithe they jab se wo kaha gaya tha jo kaha gaya tha, is se pehle, aur ek mahina guzar gaya tha ke mere mamle mein Aap ki taraf kuch wahi na hui, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tashahhud parha jab baithe, phir farmaya: Us ke baad Ae Aisha! Beshak mujhe tumhare bare mein ye ye pahunchi hai, phir agar tum bari ho to Allah tumhe bari karega, aur agar tum gunah ko pahunchi ho to Allah se istighfar karo aur Us ki taraf tauba karo, phir beshak banda jab iqrar kare phir tauba kare to Allah us par tauba karta hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni baat poori ki to mere aansu sukh gaye yahan tak ke main us mein se ek qatra na mehsoos karti, phir main ne apne walid se kaha: Meri taraf se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab do jo Aap ne farmaya, phir mere walid ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main nahi janta Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kya kahun, phir main ne apni walida se kaha: Meri taraf se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab do jo Aap ne farmaya, phir meri walida ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main nahi janti Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kya kahun, phir main ne kaha, aur main kam umr londi thi Quran zyada na parhti thi: Beshak main, Allah ki qasam, jan chuki hun, tum ne ye baat suni hai yahan tak ke wo tumhare dilon mein jam gayi hai aur tum ne us ki tasdeeq ki hai, phir agar main tum se kahun ke main bari hun to tum meri tasdeeq na karoge, aur agar main tumhare samne kisi mamle ka iqrar karun, aur Allah janta hai ke main us se bari hun, to tum meri tasdeeq karoge, phir Allah ki qasam main apne liye aur tumhare liye Yusuf ke walid ke siwa koi misaal nahi pati jab unhon ne kaha: (Phir sabr jameel hai aur Allah se madad mangi jati hai us par jo tum bayan karte ho), phir main phir gayi aur apne bistar par let gayi, aur Allah janta hai ke main us waqt bari thi aur Allah meri baraat se mujhe bari karne wala hai, lekin Allah ki qasam main ye gumaan na karti thi ke Allah mere mamle mein wahi nazil karega jo parhi jayegi, mera mamla meri zaat mein is se haqeer tha ke Allah mere bare mein kisi mamle mein kalam kare, lekin main umeed karti thi ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) neend mein khwab dekhenge jis se Allah mujhe bari karega, phir Allah ki qasam Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni majlis se harkat na ki aur na ghar walon mein se koi bahar nikla yahan tak ke Aap par wahi nazil hui, phir Aap ko wo lene laga jo leta tha sakhti se yahan tak ke Aap se paseena motiyon jaisa behne laga, jabke Aap sard din mein they, us qaul ke bojh se jo Aap par nazil hua tha, unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se door kiya gaya jabke Aap hans rahe they, phir pehla kalima jo Aap ne kaha ye tha ke farmaya: Ae Aisha! Raha Allah to Us ne tumhe bari kiya hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir meri walida ne mujh se kaha: Un ki taraf utho, phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main un ki taraf na uthungi, phir beshak main Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa kisi ki hamd nahi karti, unhon ne kaha: Aur Allah Taala ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Beshak jo log ifk lekar aaye tum mein se ek jatha hain, use apne liye shar na samjho balke wo tumhare liye khair hai, un mein se har shakhs ke liye us gunah mein se hai jo us ne kamaya, aur jis ne un mein se bade ka bojh uthaya us ke liye azeem azab hai, jab tum ne use suna to momin mardon aur momin aurton ne apne dilon mein khair kyun na samjha aur kaha ye khula ifk hai, wo us par chaar gawah kyun na laye, phir jab wo gawah na laye to wo Allah ke paas jhoote hain, aur agar tum par Allah ka fazl aur duniya aur aakhirat mein Us ki rehmat na hoti to tumhe us mein azeem azab pahunchta jismein tum beh rahe they, jab tum use apni zabano se lete they aur apne munhon se wo kehte they jis ka tumhe ilm nahi, aur use halka samajhte they jabke wo Allah ke paas azeem hai, aur jab tum ne use suna to kyun na kaha ke hamein ye nahi ke is se kalam karein, Tu paak hai ye azeem bohtan hai, Allah tumhe naseehat karta hai ke aisa kabhi na karna agar tum momin ho, aur Allah tumhare liye ayatein bayan karta hai, aur Allah janne wala hikmat wala hai, beshak jo pasand karte hain ke fahisha un mein phail jaye jo iman laye un ke liye duniya aur aakhirat mein dardnak azab hai, aur Allah janta hai aur tum nahi jante, aur agar tum par Allah ka fazl aur Us ki rehmat na hoti aur beshak Allah narm rehem wala hai, ae wo jo iman laye shaitan ke qadmon par na chalo, aur jo shaitan ke qadmon par chale to wo fahisha aur munkar ka hukm deta hai, aur agar tum par Allah ka fazl aur Us ki rehmat na hoti to tum mein se koi kabhi paak na hota lekin Allah jise chahta hai paak karta hai, aur Allah sunne wala janne wala hai, aur tum mein se fazl aur kushadgi wale qasam na khayein ke rishtedaron, miskeenon aur Allah ki rah mein hijrat karne walon ko dein, aur chahiye ke maaf karein aur darguzar karein, kya tum pasand nahi karte ke Allah tumhe bakhshe, aur Allah bakhshne wala rehem wala hai, beshak jo pakeezah ghafil momin aurton par tohmat lagate hain wo duniya aur aakhirat mein lanat kiye gaye aur un ke liye azeem azab hai, jis din un ke khilaf un ki zabanein, haath aur paon gawahi denge jo wo karte they, us din Allah unhe un ka sachcha badla poora dega aur wo janenge ke Allah hi Haq wazeh karne wala hai, khabees aurtein khabees mardon ke liye aur khabees mard khabees aurton ke liye, aur pakeezah aurtein pakeezah mardon ke liye aur pakeezah mard pakeezah aurton ke liye, ye un se bari hain jo wo kehte hain, un ke liye maghfirat aur izzat wala rizq hai), phir Allah ne meri baraat mein ye nazil farmaya, Abu Bakr Siddiq ne kaha, aur wo Mistah bin Usasa par us ki rishtedari aur faqr ki wajah se kharch karte they: Allah ki qasam main Mistah par kabhi kuch kharch na karunga, us ke baad jo us ne Aisha ke bare mein kaha jo kaha, phir Allah ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Aur tum mein se fazl wale qasam na khayein) is qaul tak: (bakhshne wala rehem wala hai), Abu Bakr Siddiq ne kaha: Haan Allah ki qasam beshak main pasand karta hun ke Allah mujhe bakhshe, phir wo Mistah ke us kharch ki taraf wapas aaye jo wo us par karte they aur kaha: Allah ki qasam main use us se kabhi na cheenunga, Aisha ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zainab bint Jahsh se mere mamle ke bare mein poocha tha, phir Zainab se farmaya: Tune kya jana ya dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main apne kaan aur aankh bachati hun, Allah ki qasam main ne khair ke siwa kuch nahi jana, Aisha ne kaha: Aur wo wo thi jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se mujh se barabari karti thi, phir Allah ne use parhezgari se bachaya, unhon ne kaha: Aur us ki behen Hamna us ke liye ladne lagi aur halak hone walon mein halak hui, Aisha ne kaha: Aur Allah ki qasam beshak wo mard jis ke bare mein wo kaha gaya jo kaha gaya, kehta hai: SubhanAllah, phir Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai main ne kabhi kisi aurat ka parda na khola, unhon ne kaha: Phir wo us ke baad Allah ki rah mein qatl kiya gaya."
"1764","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab mere mamle ka zikr hua jo zikr hua, aur main use na janti thi, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere bare mein khutba dene khade hue, phir tashahhud parha, phir Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana ki jis ka Wo ehel hai, phir farmaya: Us ke baad mujhe un logon ke bare mein mashwara do jinhon ne mere ghar walon par tohmat lagai hai, aur Allah ki qasam main ne apne ghar walon par burai nahi jani, aur wo unhe us shakhs ke sath jodte hain, aur Allah ki qasam main ne us par kabhi burai nahi jani, aur wo kabhi mere ghar mein dakhil nahi hota magar main hazir hota hun, aur main safar mein ghayab nahi hota magar wo mere sath ghayab hota hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere ghar tashreef laye aur meri khadima se mere bare mein poocha, phir us ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam main ne us par koi aib nahi jana siwaye is ke ke wo so jati thi yahan tak ke bakri aati aur us ka khameer ya aata kha jati, aur Aap ke baaz sahaba ne use danta aur kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sach batao, yahan tak ke unhon ne use us se gira diya, phir us ne kaha: SubhanAllah, Allah ki qasam main ne us par us ke siwa kuch nahi jana jo sunar surkh sone ki dali par janta hai, aur mamla us mard tak pahunchi jis ke bare mein kaha gaya tha, phir us ne kaha: SubhanAllah, Allah ki qasam main ne kabhi kisi aurat ka parda na khola, Aisha ne kaha: Phir wo Allah ki rah mein shaheed qatl kiya gaya."
